s/pixel/netherlands.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Nederlands (Nederland)\" /> | **Nederlands (Nederland)** | Sindarin27, Jelle |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/poland.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Polski (Polska)\" /> | **Polski (Polska)** | Matzetix |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/brazil.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Português (Brasil)\" /> | **Português (Brasil)** | cesarlopesg354035, Mikeliro |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/russia.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Русский (Russkiy)\" /> | **Русский (Russkiy)** | PinkGoose |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/sweden.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Svenska (Sverige)\" /> | **Svenska (Sverige)** | 1019milo |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/turkey.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Türkçe (Türkiye)\" /> | **Türkçe (Türkiye)** | CreepSkeet |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/china.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"简体中文（中国大陆）\" /> | **简体中文（中国大陆）** | S0ar1ngDeath, likefishlike |\n\n<hr />\n<br>\n\n<span><strong>🤚 支持：如果您对我们的模组有任何疑问或问题，请阅读常见问题解答！您也可以<a href=\"https://gitlab.com/groups/modding-legacy/-/issues\">在问题追踪器上提交问题</a>，或加入我们的 Discord 服务器，我们将为您提供帮助！</strong></span>\n<br><br>\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/thBV2Mq\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/223938153260515328/widget.png?style=banner3\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 服务器\" /></a>\n<br>",
